# TYRANT v0.2.1 Patch Notes

## Core Rules

- Keyword Ability **Tough**: Now reduces ⚔️ taken by 1 (to a minimum of 1). Previously reduced to a minimum of 0.

## Tyrant

- Bombard: Changed "3⚔️ to all heroes, 1⚔️ to all allies." -> "4⚔️ to all heroes, 1⚔️ to all allies."

## Shaman

- Core
	- Flame Shock: Changed "Duration(5)" -> "Duration(4)"

- Enhancement
	- Lava Lash: Changed "If the target has Flame Shock attached, **reclaim** this." -> "You may sacrifice a Flame Shock on the target. If you do, +X⚔️, where X is the number of counters remaining on it."
	- Static Charge Totem: Now has a maximum of 5 charges.

- Elemental
	- Stonewall Totem: 🛡️ increased 1 -> 2
